Hi {Owner},

I build websites for towing companies around {City}. When I searched for towing in your area, out-of-area call centers came up first, while {Business Name} has real trucks and reviews but no site of its own.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: a tap-to-call bar, a roadside request that shares the driver's location, a 'find my towed car' page and a private property towing page for managers, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
